            "review_text": "mascotty02\nGreater Manchester, United Kingdom504 contributions\n0\nwelcoming and friendly\nJun 2018 • Couples\nWalked past this one evening and had a look at the menu and advised we would go back to try it, again not too far from the Sunrise hotel, on one of the back streets behind it.\nWe were most impressed the friendliness of the staff and they had also informed us that they had recently opened so maybe not all stock was in at the moment, we were happy with this and we ordered and again the food was brilliant and filling, it was clean and would definitely visit again and recommend this restaurant,\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 3, 2018",
